This is the successful openssl command we had

`openssl s_server -cert ssl_certificate.pem -key 0x81000006 -keyform engine -engine tpm2tss -cipher AES128-GCM-SHA256 -debug -msg -min_protocol TLSv1.2 -max_protocol TLSv1.2 -accept 4433-cert_chain cachain.pem`

